---
// "Developed by Y Combinator Alumni" trust badge for the hero on every LP.
---
<p class="yc">
  <svg class="yc__logo" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="24" height="24" rx="4" fill="#f26625" /><path d="M6.2 5.5h2.9l2.9 5.1 2.9-5.1h2.9l-4.4 7.4v5.6h-2.8v-5.6z" fill="#fff" /></svg>
  <span>Developed by <b>Y Combinator</b> Alumni</span>
</p>
<style>
  .yc { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; width: fit-content; padding: 5px 14px 5px 5px; border: 1px solid rgba(3,0,37,.1); border-radius: 99px; background: #fff; box-shadow: 0 4px 12px -6px rgba(36,32,61,.18); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.2; }
  .yc b { font-weight: 700; color: #f26625; }
  .yc__logo { width: 22px; height: 22px; flex: none; }
</style>
